Berhenti!

23:12.980 --> 23:13.710
Jangan lari!

23:13.920 --> 23:14.520
Berhenti!

23:38.310 --> 23:40.370
Kenapa hanya mengincar aku seorang?

23:47.830 --> 23:49.030
